Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-- Usagi Drop Episode 05 --
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.32,0:00:19.57,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.57,0:00:20.97,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.33,0:00:29.17,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.46,0:00:34.42,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You were just dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.43,0:00:35.93,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,There's nothing to be afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.69,0:00:43.83,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Huh?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.44,0:02:14.86,Presented By,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(165,0)\blur0.4\pos(591,287)}Presented by:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.44,0:02:14.86,Presented By,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(165,0)\blur0.4\pos(775,287)}Taka Fansubs
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.02,0:02:42.90,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll have one too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.72,0:02:50.85,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I used to make them for Grandpa too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.85,0:02:54.56,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You did?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.78,0:03:01.53,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I want a kitchen knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.53,0:03:04.96,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I think you're a little young for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.96,0:03:06.76,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,They have ones for kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.76,0:03:07.98,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.97,0:03:13.94,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.22,0:03:17.44,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, let's eat quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.44,0:03:18.53,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,We have to leave soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.53,0:03:19.64,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.72,0:03:36.11,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't that baby cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.42,0:03:39.56,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.24,0:03:48.12,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I'm Kawachi, a relative of Kaga Rin-san.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.12,0:03:52.04,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Rin-san, I mean Rin and I are\Nliving together at the moment.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.33,0:03:55.00,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Oh.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.00,0:03:58.55,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Umm, you are Yoshii Masako-san, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.55,0:04:01.34,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin's mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.34,0:04:03.88,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Umm...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.88,0:04:07.09,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Me? Oh, yes.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.93,0:04:10.72,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I want to meet you in person to discuss some things.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.72,0:04:14.81,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I don't mind coming close to where you live, so could you pick a place?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.81,0:04:17.77,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}A place? Umm...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.77,0:04:19.27,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Let's see...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.27,0:04:21.07,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}How about near the shopping district{\fscx250}-{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.07,0:04:24.91,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, but I have no idea where you live.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.83,0:04:38.54,Wh,,0000,0000,0000,,{\p1\pos(809,686)}m 0 0 l 16 0 16 15 0 15{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.83,0:04:38.54,Wh,,0000,0000,0000,,{\p1\pos(816,680)}m 0 5 l 19 0 19 18 0 18{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.83,0:04:38.54,Wh,,0000,0000,0000,,{\p1\pos(843,659)}m 0 5 l 22 0 22 20 0 20{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.83,0:04:38.54,Wh,,0000,0000,0000,,{\p1\pos(838,669)}m 0 5 l 18 0 18 15 0 15{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.83,0:04:38.54,Wh,,0000,0000,0000,,{\p1\pos(875,635)}m 0 5 l 20 0 20 18 0 18{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.83,0:04:38.54,Wh,,0000,0000,0000,,{\p1\pos(897,629)}m 0 0 l 20 0 20 23 0 23{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.83,0:04:38.54,Wh,,0000,0000,0000,,{\p1\pos(885,639)}m 0 5 l 13 0 13 10 0 10{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.83,0:04:38.54,Wh2,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.4\pos(866,660)}Kaga Rin
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.54,0:04:40.15,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.15,0:04:42.54,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You made more, Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.54,0:04:44.23,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Did you make this flower too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.23,0:04:46.99,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I sure did! It's called embroidery.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.99,0:04:50.27,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Wow! You're amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.27,0:04:54.26,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Once you're a little older, I'll show you how to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.26,0:04:55.51,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.51,0:04:57.82,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,You're good with your hands, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.01,0:05:03.66,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,So, what are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.66,0:05:05.97,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I guess I'll decide after I meet her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.97,0:05:08.76,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Watch over Rin for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.76,0:05:09.99,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.95,0:05:14.86,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,This is an important step, so take your time to talk things over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.87,0:05:17.37,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Your mother wanted to spend some time with Rin anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.84,0:05:30.47,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}She wasn't kidding. This really is close to Grandpa's house.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.25,0:05:32.59,Main,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.59,0:05:34.24,Main,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Table for one?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.24,0:05:36.32,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No, there's someone else coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.32,0:05:37.18,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Non-smoking, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.43,0:05:39.52,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Careful! You might spill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.52,0:05:41.48,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,My stress just keeps piling up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.48,0:05:42.88,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I know what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.88,0:05:44.42,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll have an Americano. {coffee}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.42,0:05:46.81,Main,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, one Americano.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.81,0:05:48.49,Main,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Will that be all?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.49,0:05:48.95,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.16,0:05:53.33,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,This is great, Saionji-sensei.\NI knew I could count on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.33,0:05:56.90,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Now, just add a couple of\Ntraumatic events for each character.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.90,0:05:58.67,Main,Sai,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't that a bit much?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.67,0:06:01.35,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,No, I think it'll be just perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.35,0:06:02.74,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}That's strange.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.75,0:06:07.59,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}She took every measure to remove all traces of herself from Grandpa's house, yet she still lives so close by?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.59,0:06:10.12,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, I'll leave it up to you, Sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.12,0:06:11.92,Main,Sai,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.86,0:06:15.43,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}She didn't do a very good job of running away.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.43,0:06:17.25,Main,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,Mama, I have to pee!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.25,0:06:19.31,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, just hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.65,0:06:21.73,Cell,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.3\pos(504,316)}Yoshii Masako
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.73,0:06:21.86,Cell,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.3\pos(503,338)}Yoshii Masako
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.86,0:06:21.98,Cell,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.3\pos(520,342)}Yoshii Masako
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.98,0:06:22.11,Cell2,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.5\pos(664,370)}Yoshii Masako
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.11,0:06:22.23,Cell2,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.5\pos(670,374)}Yoshii Masako
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.23,0:06:22.36,Cell2,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.5\pos(673,377)}Yoshii Masako
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.36,0:06:22.90,Cell2,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.5\pos(677,378)}Yoshii Masako
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.98,0:06:26.28,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hello, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.28,0:06:28.74,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I'm already inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.00,0:06:40.76,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Souichi-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.75,0:06:43.46,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No, I'm his grandson.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.34,0:06:53.10,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}She looks like a kid.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.10,0:06:57.69,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, you just look so much like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.69,0:07:01.03,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay, I've been hearing that a lot lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.71,0:07:07.35,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Still, I think Souichi-san seemed more kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.35,0:07:08.32,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.70,0:07:12.53,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I brought a picture of Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.53,0:07:15.22,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.22,0:07:17.38,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That was at the beginning of this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.38,0:07:19.61,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,They were making rice cakes at her daycare.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.57,0:07:26.88,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, she's like a young lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.76,0:07:38.27,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Who was calling you "Sensei" earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.27,0:07:39.76,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,You saw that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.76,0:07:41.13,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But that name...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.13,0:07:42.49,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,It's my pen name.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.49,0:07:47.68,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I'm a total mess after staying up all night working to meet my deadline.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.49,0:07:55.91,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Did you leave Rin because of your work?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.91,0:07:58.12,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,What? Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.12,0:08:01.46,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You made Rin believe you were Grandpa's maid,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.46,0:08:03.67,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,but has it been like that since she was born?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.67,0:08:06.69,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Umm, my work was the reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.69,0:08:11.48,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,But I was also Souichi-san's maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.47,0:08:16.55,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I chose not to consider Rin as my daughter even when I was pregnant with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.55,0:08:18.86,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I don't get what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.86,0:08:21.22,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I was never well known. {as an author/mangaka}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.22,0:08:25.10,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,And just when I finally got a big break, I found out I was pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.10,0:08:28.83,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,It's not the kind of job where you can raise a child at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.83,0:08:31.63,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,But Souichi-san said I should have the child.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.61,0:08:36.07,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Every day I'd either work or lay in bed, constantly getting fatter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.07,0:08:42.57,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,But to my surprise, after Rin was born, she was so cute that I began to love her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.58,0:08:45.50,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}She was surprised?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.50,0:08:50.10,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,That's why, even though I kept telling\Nmyself I wasn't going to be her mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.10,0:08:52.92,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I gave it my all to work and raise her at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.92,0:08:57.33,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,But getting my lifestyle accustomed to daytime was tough,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.34,0:09:00.93,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,and because many of my meetings were scheduled at night, I had to stay awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.93,0:09:03.39,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,It was physically exhausting for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.65,0:09:14.21,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I heard that Rin used to stay with you in your apartment at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.21,0:09:15.09,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.09,0:09:17.17,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Did you go out sometimes at night then?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.17,0:09:20.05,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it was more like the middle of the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.05,0:09:22.84,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'd go out for a bit after she fell asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.84,0:09:25.16,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,And sometimes Souichi-san would watch over her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.46,0:09:29.50,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin wakes up in the middle of the night even now, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.50,0:09:35.78,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't you ever consider how she felt when no one was beside her when she woke up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.78,0:09:39.26,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,How else was I supposed to raise her by myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.26,0:09:43.43,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't my grandfather want the\Nthree of you to live as a family?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.31,0:09:49.69,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Would it be alright with you if Rin continued to live with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.85,0:09:54.02,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.02,0:09:56.61,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not her mother anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.61,0:09:59.21,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I can't decide for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.21,0:10:03.17,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Even though there's no doubt you gave birth to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.16,0:10:05.41,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,That's totally unrelated!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.08,0:10:09.78,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What do you actually think of Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.78,0:10:12.03,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Is she dear to you or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.32,0:10:16.34,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.27,0:10:34.11,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Umm, I have one favor to ask of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.11,0:10:35.40,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.40,0:10:40.50,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,When it's time for her to enter school, please let her use your surname.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.50,0:10:42.19,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? My surname?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.19,0:10:45.83,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,If she has a different surname than her guardian's, she might get picked on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.83,0:10:48.48,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Could you promise me this one thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.48,0:10:52.22,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I understand what you're saying,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.22,0:10:54.75,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,but I don't think I can make you a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.75,0:11:00.34,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She's always been Kaga Rin. Changing her name like that won't be so easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.34,0:11:05.56,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,As a woman, I don't really have\Nany attachment to my surname.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.56,0:11:08.31,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,It could change someday anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.06,0:11:12.60,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Rin's a woman too. I'm sure she feels the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.60,0:11:16.19,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Except she's only six.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.19,0:11:18.72,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, that's not what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.72,0:11:21.09,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,And besides, that's just your personal opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.07,0:11:22.78,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Only one thing matters!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.78,0:11:25.65,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,The name Souichi-san gave her, "Rin."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.66,0:11:26.76,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.76,0:11:27.64,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.87,0:11:30.49,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.50,0:11:34.08,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a man, so I don't really\Nunderstand what you're getting at,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.08,0:11:37.16,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,but I'll talk with Rin about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.16,0:11:38.79,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Talk with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.80,0:11:42.09,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you think it's cruel to ask a girl as young as her to make such a decision?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.09,0:11:43.05,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.18,0:11:47.85,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm only thinking of what's best for Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.76,0:11:51.93,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, it's cruel for {\i1}us{\i0} to decide for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.93,0:11:53.83,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll find out how she feels about it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.81,0:11:58.27,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,And after the two of us make a decision, I'll let you know of the outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.83,0:12:14.96,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,She sounds like a bad egg to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.96,0:12:18.00,MainLow,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,How could anyone abandon such a cute girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.00,0:12:18.89,MainLow,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It's absurd!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.89,0:12:22.33,MainLow,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, she still worries about Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.33,0:12:24.76,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She's just a little strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.76,0:12:27.46,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She doesn't realize she's dragging others into her problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.47,0:12:31.10,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,What are you talking about?!\NAll mothers worry about their children!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.10,0:12:33.19,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,But if she really cared about her, she'd come and see her!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.19,0:12:36.61,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Easy, easy, I'm sure she has her reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.61,0:12:37.53,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Here. {he passes her an orange}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.18,0:12:41.77,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,What did Grandpa see in her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.77,0:12:45.59,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That doesn't really matter now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.57,0:12:50.20,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She did ask that Rin uses my surname once she enters school though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.20,0:12:53.14,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I agree with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.79,0:12:58.17,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It's natural that a child should have\Nthe same surname as their guardian's.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.17,0:13:01.42,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, I get that,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.42,0:13:03.77,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,but how do I explain that to Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.76,0:13:05.13,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She already has a real name.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.13,0:13:07.42,MainLow,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Well, since she's a girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.42,0:13:10.90,MainLow,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,her surname will change anyway once she gets married.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.90,0:13:12.21,MainLow,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.21,0:13:13.69,MainLow,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.69,0:13:16.74,MainLow,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,If she's going to get teased just because of her name,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.74,0:13:19.42,MainLow,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,why not let her use our surname?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.42,0:13:23.07,MainLow,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You really think she'll be able to switch names that easily?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.07,0:13:26.83,MainLow,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Things can be tough, even in elementary school.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.82,0:13:28.91,MainLow,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'm positive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.87,0:13:34.78,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Then I'll adopt her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.79,0:13:36.16,Main,Both,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.16,0:13:37.29,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,If she's okay with it, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.29,0:13:39.80,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Then she'll officially be Kawachi Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.80,0:13:41.82,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's much more natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.80,0:13:45.30,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Don't bring up something like that so carelessly!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.30,0:13:46.78,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not being careless!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.78,0:13:48.46,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,We have to decide one way or another, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.46,0:13:49.89,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It doesn't matter when we decide!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.89,0:13:51.08,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Now, now...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.08,0:13:52.28,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It {\i1}does{\i0} matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.28,0:13:53.82,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No, it doesn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.90,0:13:58.78,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not going to let Rin be passed around again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.77,0:14:01.77,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,There's no way I could do that to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.68,0:14:07.64,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll face whatever comes for Rin's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.75,0:14:12.15,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.15,0:14:14.45,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,For me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.45,0:14:15.94,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yup, for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.94,0:14:19.95,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But, you can only use it when I'm with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.95,0:14:22.32,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Promise me that and the knife is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.03,0:14:24.09,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.02,0:14:28.87,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I know! I'll make curry for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.87,0:14:30.44,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.44,0:14:31.07,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.07,0:14:33.78,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,How about tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.23,0:14:43.98,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Umm, do I push or pull?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.78,0:14:46.03,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.03,0:14:47.23,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Let me try.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.57,0:14:51.24,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.24,0:14:53.67,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You're good at that, Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.67,0:14:56.66,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I lived by myself for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.66,0:14:58.06,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.06,0:14:59.54,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Nice and slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.17,0:15:12.88,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't drink the water in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.88,0:15:13.76,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.09,0:15:23.57,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Alright, go down to your shoulders and count to ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.57,0:15:24.62,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.62,0:15:29.32,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,One, two, three, four, shut the door. {nursery rhyme}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.32,0:15:31.35,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Five, six, pick up sticks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.35,0:15:33.35,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Seven, eight...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.35,0:15:34.88,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.62,0:15:28.24,Overlap,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,One, two...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.24,0:15:31.92,Overlap,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Three, four...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.92,0:15:34.88,Overlap,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Five, six...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.21,0:15:41.95,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't be in such a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.95,0:15:42.95,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.11,0:15:45.48,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.48,0:15:46.74,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.75,0:15:47.92,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Never mind. 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.24,0:15:53.38,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's delicious! {Doesn't he say "Your curry's delicious"?}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.00,0:16:09.48,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Do I have to gargle that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.48,0:16:12.39,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Umm, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.18,0:16:16.15,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Rin...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.15,0:16:18.97,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not your dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.97,0:16:20.34,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.33,0:16:22.29,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,And I'm not your older brother either, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.29,0:16:25.81,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Nobody thinks that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.81,0:16:27.12,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's just an example!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.13,0:16:29.00,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,So then who am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.69,0:16:31.20,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You're Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.20,0:16:33.20,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's just my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.20,0:16:34.10,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.10,0:16:36.75,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,This is only if you're up for it,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.75,0:16:39.86,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,but, how should I put it...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.85,0:16:43.31,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Would you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.31,0:16:48.11,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Would you be okay with me becoming your real dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.92,0:16:51.86,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi? My dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.86,0:16:57.62,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Also, your name would change to "Kawachi Rin."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.62,0:17:00.20,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi Rin...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.66,0:17:04.66,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.40,0:17:06.59,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.59,0:17:08.85,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Wouldn't it be better if I was your dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.85,0:17:11.41,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,My dad is Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.41,0:17:14.20,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,And I like this name, "Kaga Rin."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.22,0:17:17.30,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I like it because it's the same name as Grandpa's.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.82,0:17:21.33,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.27,0:17:24.26,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You're fine just as Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.28,0:17:32.10,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.10,0:17:33.15,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.15,0:17:35.11,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's sweat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.11,0:17:37.41,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,In March?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.41,0:17:39.51,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Be quiet and open your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.51,0:17:41.88,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It was open, but you were too busy crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.87,0:17:43.29,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I said I wasn't crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.70,0:17:47.26,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Chin up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.26,0:17:48.32,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.13,0:17:54.30,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,This'll always be your home, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.30,0:17:56.07,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.22,0:18:08.19,Cgts1,,0000,0000,0000,,{\p1\pos(648,161)}m 0 0 l 520 0 520 78 0 78{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.22,0:18:08.19,Cgts2,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.5\pos(580,121)}Congratulations
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.22,0:18:08.19,Cgts3,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.5\pos(768,122)}on
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.22,0:18:08.19,Cgts4,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.5\pos(576,164)}Graduating
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.22,0:18:08.19,Cgts5,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.5\pos(769,164)}Daycare!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.51,0:18:10.01,Main,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,"We can never forget what we believe in,"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.01,0:18:18.70,Main,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,"because the sun will surely rise tomorrow."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.70,0:18:27.28,Main,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,"We can never lose what we dream of,"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.28,0:18:34.97,Main,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,"because one day they will surely come true."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.97,0:18:43.44,Main,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,"Our first step will be towards tomorrow."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.43,0:18:51.81,Main,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,"From now on, everything will be new to us."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.81,0:19:00.45,Main,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,"Our first step will be towards tomorrow."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.45,0:19:09.62,Main,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,"We'll become brave and take that first step."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.95,0:19:53.63,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.66,0:20:06.71,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,You'll get fat, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.71,0:20:10.42,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Whatever. I'm useless anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.39,0:20:12.73,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Can I have one?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.73,0:20:13.94,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.12,0:22:00.29,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Only babies are held like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.29,0:22:01.94,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,That's what Sayaka-chan said.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.94,0:22:04.33,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.33,0:22:07.35,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Even adults want to be held like that sometimes!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.35,0:22:10.09,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.09,0:22:12.17,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not really sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.17,0:22:14.48,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's alright? Even if I'm in first grade?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.48,0:22:16.25,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.72,0:22:24.40,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll hold you no matter how old you get.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.59,0:22:30.13,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.13,0:22:31.29,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.29,0:22:33.75,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I should have held you back then!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.75,0:22:34.71,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.74,0:22:40.64,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'll hold you the next time you cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.61,0:22:42.87,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}What the heck?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.60,0:22:46.62,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.36,0:22:52.43,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Am I raising Rin? Or is it the other way around?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.43,0:22:54.84,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}It's hard to tell sometimes.{\i0}
